   "sentenceId": 13,
   "he": "וְלֵימָא לֵיהּ מֵימָר? מְסַיַּיע לֵיהּ לְרַבִּי יוֹחָנָן, דְּאָמַר רַבִּי יוֹחָנָן: כְּשֵׁם שֶׁהַדִּיבּוּר יָפֶה לַבְּשָׂמִים, כָּךְ דִּיבּוּר רַע לַיַּיִן.",
   "en": "The Gemara challenges: Why does the treasurer knock with the reed; «let him» simply «speak.» The Gemara explains: This «supports» the opinion «of Rabbi Yoḥanan, as Rabbi Yoḥanan said: Just as speech is beneficial to the» incense «spices, so is speech detrimental to wine,» and so the treasurer avoids speaking."
  }
